    "sections": {
        "description": "Online Courier Services theme is a professionally structured theme designed for logistics companies, delivery startups, parcel tracking platforms, and transportation businesses that need a clean and organized website layout. The theme supports essential elements such as shipment information sections, service listings, courier booking forms, and delivery status pages, helping businesses present their logistics operations clearly. Built with a lightweight structure, it works smoothly with modern tools and allows easy customization without complex setup. This theme is suitable for courier companies, logistics service providers, freight businesses, package delivery services, and supply chain websites looking for a functional online presence. It includes layouts for courier tracking, shipment management, transportation services, and delivery booking pages. With compatibility for common plugins and a flexible design structure, Online Courier Services theme helps logistics businesses build an informative courier website, parcel service portal, or delivery management site efficiently."
    },
